{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026sBpY2tsxun1795657688.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天主教一連兩日為宏褔苑火災亡者舉行追思彌撒。</p><p></p><p>追思彌撒晚上7時，在堅道的天主教聖母無原罪主教座堂舉行。除了有神父講道，亦有追悼禮，由亡者家屬分享過去一年的心路歷程，並讀出168名在火災中離世死者的名字，以表達思念及敬意。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T02:39:20.913171+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T14:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T13:37:15.977590+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T02:32:32.399305+00:00","content_hash":"d220d84bfb97dbdc9a11c26ad845a57e33b36d60023afd1f222c5b42adc8bb57","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T02:39:20.913171+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}